      "side": 1,
      "message": "The background for this change is to resolve [this presubmit failure](https://android-build.googleplex.com/builds/pending/P49120104/linux/latest/view/logs/build.log), at which the target [sets `AllowMissingDependencies` to true](https://source.corp.google.com/android/prebuilts/build-tools/build-prebuilts.sh;rcl\u003d16dcaa60e343240b8439b0cfcdb12c2c702c4243;l\u003d84). I believe other solutions to this problem that can maintain the rule of error reporting immediately by Soong (by discarding the change) is to explicitly not generate `java_api_contribution` for `service-art`-generated droidstubs or modify the [`service-art` module definition](https://source.corp.google.com/aosp-master/art/libartservice/service/Android.bp;rcl\u003d4d14f77185c20cb5cb5050230c660374621b0b13;l\u003d68) to not include the defaults (as it is missing in the `aosp-build-tools`) branch, but both of the solutions do not sound ideal but more like hacks.",
